@startuml seq-payment
actor Person
participant App
participant "Wallet Core\n(paymaster and bundler)" as WC
participant "EntryPoint" as EP
participant "Account" as Account

Person -> App : send, pay, save or swap
App -> WC : ask for gas sponsorship
WC --> App : signed sponsorship
App -> App : the key signs the operation
App -> WC : send the operation
WC -> EP : handleOps
EP -> Account : validates the signature and executes (batched)
WC --> App : receipt
@enduml
